From 8165ec11a67727c83458b465733228bb8848ff32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 20:34:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ezhharnameh): fix representative step, preparation flow,
 and cost calculation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

1. Add missing نماينده (agent) step after مخاطب (addressee) - selects
   agent type from dropdown (سایر نمایندگان قانونی / مدیر شرکت),
   fills national ID, and queries Sana

2. Fix step name: 'آماده سازي جهت محاسبه هزينه و ارسال' ->
   'آماده سازي جهت دريافت وجه' to match actual page text,
   resolving NavigationResetError on go_back

3. Fix preparation flow (_click_preparation): use setPetitionToReadyForPaymentState
   button with confirm popup flow (تایید اطلاعات -> بستن)

4. Rewrite cost calculation (_calculate_cost):
   - Parse cost table (green td = total, red td = row items)
   - Auto-retry with 40s interval if table not shown
   - Round up to nearest 10,000 Rials
   - Sum rows 1,3,4,5 (excluding row 2: ثبت اطلاعات اشخاص)
   - final_total = rounded costSum + rounded selected rows sum

5. Update result sending to use new cost dict format (final_total)

6. Remove CRLF line endings

7. Add ADDRESSEE_AGENT_TYPE_VALUES mapping for agent dropdown
